# saas-platform: chassis only

This package is the **lower-level chassis** (contracts, DB port, entitlements, infra). It is not login UI, nav, or billing pages.

## Ask / recommend first before

- Breaking `PlatformDatabaseAdapter` or published contract shapes
- Removing tenancy/entitlement helpers consumers rely on

## Do not

- Put product domain (forms, CRM entities, PeopleForms types) here
- Add React app chrome here (that belongs in `saas-product-shell/ui`)

Product UI and dual-mode pages live in shell + `create-saas` templates.
